    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Moved 6m+ this Turn? Make a <strong>Leaping Strike</strong>: lunge 4m and attack, as half its ROF2, without spending MOVE, for 4d6. Kill a target with it and for 3 Rounds you can make a ROF1 <strong>Renzokuken</strong> (no Aimed Shot, not in a Grapple): Melee Weapon at −4 vs Evasion; on a hit roll 3d6, drop the lowest, and multiply by how much you won by, up to half your Melee Weapon level (round up). Miss and you spend your next Action recovering. A Renzokuken hit counts as two Melee Weapon hits for Martial Arts prerequisites.</p><p><strong>Class:</strong> Iconic EQ Heavy Melee<br><strong>Range table:</strong> Melee<br><strong>Damage:</strong> 3d6<br><strong>Alt. fire:</strong> Renzokuken (See Special Features)<br><strong>Fabrication:</strong> DV29 - 10,000eb - 1 Month</p><p><small>Item Compendium (2070) • Iconics</small></p>"
